accTitle: Minimal starter network
accDescr: The minimal profile creates a resource group containing three VNets, their subnets and NSGs. Spoke1 and Spoke2 have bidirectional peering. The Azure-hosted branch has no connection. VMs, gateways, Firewall and paid services remain disabled.
